  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Study Sphere, War Sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> As you have at least one point of momentum in your pool, you may spend notions from your current theory in place of momentum points so long as the subject of your theory is in some way affected by the momentum effect (for example, the effect provides a bonus to AC against the subject’s attack or the user directly attacks the subject.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc105\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
